{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269R7gPcmM8J1794647976.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名82歲婆婆在牛頭角被輕型貨車撞倒昏迷送院，司機涉嫌危險駕駛被捕。</p><p></p><p>警方中午接報，涉事輕型貨車沿著通明街，右轉入牛頭角道，撞倒正在過馬路的婆婆。40歲司機在車上協助調查。婆婆後腦受傷昏迷，送往伊利沙伯醫院救治。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T10:43:43.980775+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T09:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T10:37:00.064471+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T10:37:00.064471+00:00","content_hash":"137b5cb4282b27ec8a21cd942ee0778dff7e5671bdbc711fee5fa30591e7bfb8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}